  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Concrete Actions for the Territorialization of the SNIA at the Regional Level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the role and capacities of the Regional Councils of Tangier-Tetouan-Al-Hoceima and the Oriental regions in integrating migration dimensions into their regional planning. The project will also support to contribute to the Moroccan government&#x2019;s efforts to territorialize the National Strategy for Immigration and Asylum (SNIA) by promoting the protection and integration of migrants at the territorial level in the context of &#x201c;Advanced Regionalization&#x201d;. To achieve this objective, the project will focus on two main areas: supporting the Regional Councils in developing concrete actions for effective implementation of their regional plans for the protection and integration of migrants. Secondly, the project will support the establishment of coordination mechanisms that results from the SNIA and bring together governmental and non-governmental stakeholders acting in the field of protection and integration of migrants at the regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
